      "description": "The old default_allocator crate references six removed __rust_* allocator ABI symbols. The experiment wrapper defines all six symbols and forwards alloc, dealloc, realloc, and alloc_zeroed to the allocator selected for that arm; grow/shrink in place return the legacy cannot-resize result. This identical mechanical adapter keeps the std::Box<u64> target and all legacy Heap traffic allocator-visible without applying target link flags to build scripts.",
